* Albert Lipscomb, state senator
* Sid McDonald, former state senator
* Frank McRight, attorney and Democratic nominee for [[Alabama's 1st congressional district|AL-01]] in 1984
* [[Jeff Sessions]], Alabama [[attorney general]]
* [[Charles Woods (Alabama)|Charles Woods]], businessman and [[perennial candidate]]

